64,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka, I agree on the safety. But for Option C, the distant loans risk missing shipping cut-offs again. We must ensure the paperwork is perfect.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
