68,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, Option A is static. It respects the bay’s load limits and requires no powered maintenance. It is the only choice that keeps the building functional.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, I am glad we agree. Option A avoids the distant shipping risks I found. It feels safe and welcoming for our visitors.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
